State is machine-local at ~/.colab/ (override with COLAB_HOME). Run any command with
--help for details. Exit code is 0 on success, non-zero on failure.

Two installs of this CLI, deliberately: ~/.local/bin/colab is a symlink and follows whatever
branch the handbook clone has checked out (for your sessions), while ~/.colab/bin/colab is a
